# Use with a REST client, or follow the equivalent curl examples in README.md.
# Set these values locally; do not commit actual tokens.
@base = http://localhost:8000
@token = REPLACE_WITH_SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@account = REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID
@draft = REPLACE_WITH_DRAFT_ID

### Verify the session and initialize the local profile
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create the account first. Opening balance is at the START of opening_date.
POST {{base}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Demo M-Pesa","kind":"mpesa","opening_balance":"5000.00","opening_date":"2026-01-01"}

### Synthetic payment message -> reviewable draft; repeated input is idempotent
POST {{base}}/captures/message
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"account_id":"{{account}}","text":"UAI1234567 Confirmed. Ksh150.00 paid to NAIVAS on 10/1/26 at 3:00 PM. New M-PESA balance is Ksh4,850.00. Transaction cost, Ksh0.00."}

### Manual capture uses the same draft flow, with no AI dependency
POST {{base}}/captures/manual
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"account_id":"{{account}}","type":"expense","category":"transport","amount":"80.00","occurred_on":"2026-01-10","payment_method":"cash","description":"Synthetic bus fare"}

### Review/correct
PATCH {{base}}/drafts/{{draft}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"category":"food","amount":"150.00"}

### Confirm once; retries return the same transaction
POST {{base}}/drafts/{{draft}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Deterministic analytics
GET {{base}}/analytics/summary?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ask returns date range, decimal totals, transaction count, and evidence links
POST {{base}}/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"Where is most of my money going?"}
